re explanation about the condition when it's allowed or *not allowed* in the docs.\n\nAlso, it would be nice if there's more documentation about threading models in general.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648514870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648622003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102607#issuecomment-2648622003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102607","id":2648622003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d3sOz","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T16:39:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T16:39:22Z","body":"See [thread-safe APIs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/performance/thread_safe_apis.html) for some context","author_association":"MEMBER","p